# A phased-out permanent is treated as though it does not exist (CR 702.26b), so the static ability of its unlocked door
# applies to nothing. Bot1 casts Porcelain Gallery with Ornithopter beside it, and Opalescence makes the Room a creature:
# two creatures, so Ornithopter is 2/2. In turn 5 Talon Gates of Madara phases the Room out (CR 702.26a): Ornithopter is
# 0/2 again. At Bot1's next untap step the Room phases in with the Gallery still unlocked: Ornithopter is 2/2, and the Room
# 6/6 (Opalescence, with the later timestamp, sets it to the Gallery's mana value after the Gallery does).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Dollmaker's Shop // Porcelain Gallery
Ornithopter
Opalescence
Talon Gates of Madara
Plains x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dollmaker's Shop // Porcelain Gallery.Cast(Ability: Porcelain Gallery)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Opalescence.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Porcelain Gallery.Power = 6
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Talon Gates of Madara.Play
Bot1.Target(Porcelain Gallery)
Bot1.Pass
[T5 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 0
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
[T7 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Toughness = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Porcelain Gallery.Power = 6
Bot1.Battlefield.Porcelain Gallery.Toughness = 6
